## Key Reminders

- This is a **shared package** - changes affect all consumers
- Build is **ESM only** (no CommonJS)
- Peer dependencies are **external** (not bundled)
- Always **test in consumer apps** after changes
- Components must be **accessible** (WCAG 2.1 AA)
- Use **semantic tokens**, not hard-coded values
- **Mobile-first** responsive design
- **Type safety** is mandatory

